insert into public.cpl_memory (slug,kind,title,summary,tags,status,source,verified_by,verified_at,author,event_date) values
('p-shared-clone-origin-main-stale-s739','pitfall','The shared clone''s origin/main was days stale, so worktrees started at S719','S739: the shared clone''s origin/main sat at S719''s commit (56c38abf), so the harness made every worker''s worktree there. The conductor fetched main by name (51744a70) and told all three workers to start their branches at it before any work. Fetch main by name first in a routine run, and tell each worker its start sha.',array['conductor','git','workers','harness'],'proposed','docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('d-free-page-read-workflow-in-lift-s739','decision','A free, branch-only page read is inside the lift','S739 conductor: pooled ran free page reads through college-page-read.yml, which the lift on workers'' dispatches did not name. A free read that files to the worker''s own branch only is inside the lift''s words, as S727''s loads and S731''s paid reads in words were. Applies stayed the conductor''s.',array['conductor','workers','reads','program-requirements'],'proposed','docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('f-elcamino-02487-stale-pass-s739','fact','El Camino 02487 carries a pass the scorer rejects','S739, pooled''s second reader (MAJOR, pre-existing on main): El Camino 02487''s filed score reads pass (27-28) while the scorer gives fail (51-62 against 60), so the Commons counts a pass the scorer rejects. Its committed was step fixes it at the next El Camino reconcile; for the follow-up PR.',array['program-requirements','el-camino','scorer','follow-up'],'proposed','#3882; docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('f-shasta-30580-shares-43618-list-s739','fact','Shasta 30580 holds the same list as 43618','S739, the second reader of s739a and s739b (MINOR): Shasta 30580 holds the same list as 43618, both from one ''Communication Studies 2.0'' section, so 30580 looks mis-filed. Left alone tonight; the follow-up PR checks it beside 43618.',array['program-requirements','shasta','follow-up'],'proposed','docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('f-heading-apart-both-awards-s739','fact','The heading-apart guard let both same-title sisters claim own_heading','S739, the reader of s739e to s739g (MAJOR, hit by no row): _heading_apart in kb/_program_piles_s739.py let both same-title sisters claim own_heading when the heading names both awards (Palomar''s ''A.A. Degree Major or Certificate of Achievement'': 27 of 348 identical-heading sister pairs). piles fixed it with a Palomar-shaped test before any later plan used it.',array['program-requirements','piles','own-page-guard','review'],'proposed','#3883; docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('d-land-applied-piles-apart-s739','decision','Applied piles land from a branch cut apart from the working branch','S739 conductor: applied plans s739a to s739h landed from claude/s739-piles-land, cut at the last apply''s .apply restore and brought up to main by a worker that wrote no data, while piles kept writing s739i and s739j on its own branch. #3883 merged at 10:27Z; the working branch lands later with its receipts.',array['conductor','merge','land','program-requirements'],'proposed','#3883; docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('p-new-ci-step-docs-only-skip-needs-list-s739','pitfall','A new test step with the docs-only skip needs a line in the skip list','S739: #3882''s test failed lints 2 and 5 (run 45784375158) and #3883''s lints 2 and 6 (45793085708). A new test step carrying the docs-only skip needs its line in tests/lints_docs_only_skip.json (it then runs on every diff), and a page plan that reads http pages names the http_hosts reason.',array['ci','tests','lints','land'],'proposed','#3882; #3883',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('p-older-pile-tests-pin-runs-later-plans-move-s739','pitfall','An older pile test that pins posted runs fails when a later plan posts on top','S739: a plan''s test that pins a record''s posted run fails once a later plan posts on top of it. #3883''s lints 6 failed on program_piles_s727_shasta_test.py (s739b) and program_piles_s727_canyons_test.py (15477''s run, s739c); each now takes skip=. Run all 47 piles and reconcile tests before a push.',array['tests','program-requirements','ci','piles'],'proposed','#3883',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('d-within-range-sums-hold-for-units-kind-s739','decision','A units sum inside its printed range files no noted_figures_differ gap','S739 conductor, on a Sonnet reader''s MAJOR: Gavilan 08460, 19378, 38787, 41394 and Orange Coast 41373 had sums inside their printed ranges (36 in 30-36 and so on), S703''s within-range case. The four left s739m (5 rows), 41373 rolled back from s739j''s receipt; all five hold for a units twin of hours_within_printed_range, with Shasta 32162 and College of the Canyons 36793.',array['program-requirements','named-gaps','gavilan','rollback'],'proposed','#3883; docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('f-four-new-named-gap-labels-s739','fact','Four new named-gap labels no matcher reads','S739, waveA''s reader: catalog_list_differs, certificate_names_the_major, list_printed_as_number_run and catalog_renumbered are free text in inert named_gaps_s739.json files. No census or kb/_program_named_gaps.py match reads them, and none may without a recall test showing it joins nothing it should not.',array['program-requirements','named-gaps','census','follow-up'],'proposed','docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('d-one-land-for-piles2-and-waves-s739','decision','piles2, waveA and waveB land as one PR off main','S739 conductor: piles2 (s739i to s739n and 41373''s rollback), waveA and waveB land as one PR off main once the applies finish, as S731''s #3830 did. waveA must take main and regenerate its Commons files first (its hand-set commons.json value matched its base, not main).',array['conductor','land','merge','program-requirements'],'proposed','docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26'),
('m-collection-s739','milestone','S739''s collection: 99 records at the 11:14Z headline','S739 (2026-11-26, the routine''s 06:12Z run): 99 records collected, 22 live by reads and loads and 77 by guarded plans (14 passing on a rename, 63 named gaps), plus 30 named gaps for programs with no record. Display 3a699eddc8c9; census after it 15,578 of 20,282 pass. Headline 15,610 complete at 118 colleges. Paid reads about $1.23.',array['program-requirements','collection','milestone'],'proposed','#3880; #3881; #3882; #3883; docs/session_740_handoff.md',null,null,'SkyOystercatcher (S739)','2026-11-26')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

